        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Electricity, medium voltage, GO supply mix
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.\nTime period: Time of publications.\nVersion: 1\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Elektrizität\nLocal subcategory: Erzeugungsmix\nUVEK 2022 source file:726-Strommixe-EU_v0.8._X-GO supply mix Distribution.xml\n\n
UUID: 0c469b5e-4249-3ef5-b0f9-84ddb1ae545f
Included are the electricity production in PL, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: undefined
Technology: undefined
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
